      "widgets_values": [
        "A mysterious figure walks down a foggy, urban street at night. The person is dressed in a long, dark, hooded cloak with the hood up, obscuring their face. They wear black gloves, a brown utility belt with various pouches, and black boots. A glowing blue lightsaber is held in the left hand, while a glowing red lightsaber is sheathed on the right side of the belt. The street is wet, reflecting the neon signs and blurred figures in the background. The figure's cloak is slightly open at the front, revealing a dark tunic underneath. The overall appearance is that of a stealthy, futuristic warrior. The background includes tall buildings with illuminated signs, adding to the urban, dystopian atmosphere."
